cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "GraceDB MCP: a Model Context Protocol server for gravitational-wave alerts"
abstract: >-
  An open-source Model Context Protocol (MCP) server that gives LLM agents access to
  LIGO/Virgo/KAGRA gravitational-wave alerts from GraceDB, published catalogue events
  and public strain data from the Gravitational Wave Open Science Center (GWOSC).
authors:
  - given-names: Izabela
    family-names: Jilavu
    alias: izabelamaria24
repository-code: "https://github.com/izabelamaria24/gracedb-mcp"
url: "https://pypi.org/project/gracedb-mcp/"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
keywords:
  - gravitational waves
  - LIGO
  - Virgo
  - KAGRA
  - GraceDB
  - GWOSC
  - Model Context Protocol
  - LLM agents
